logs/**
resources/**
results/**
.snakemake/**
# data/ holds tens of GB of real reads, so ignore it by default -- but keep
# the small toy dataset the Test experiment runs on, so that a fresh clone can
# verify the pipeline end to end. The reference.fa.{amb,ann,bwt,fai,pac,sa}
# indices stay ignored: they are derived, and since the stage_reference rule
# they are generated into resources/ref/ rather than beside the FASTA.
data/**
!data/reads/
!data/reads/Mut_R1.fq
!data/reads/Mut_R2.fq
!data/reads/WT_R1.fq
!data/reads/WT_R2.fq
!data/mut.csv
!data/mut.fa
!data/reference.fa